@startuml
title sunnet.Call / sunnet.Ret 时序

actor "Lua服务A\n调用方协程" as LuaA
participant "LuaApi::Call\nsrc/LuaApi.cpp" as CallApi
participant "Service A\nsrc/Service.cpp" as SrvA
participant "Sunnet\nsrc/Sunnet.cpp" as Sunnet
participant "目标Service B\nmsgQueue" as SrvB
participant "Worker线程\nsrc/Worker.cpp" as Worker
participant "Service::OnServiceMsg\nsrc/Service.cpp" as OnMsgB
participant "Lua服务B\nOnServiceMsg coroutine" as LuaB
participant "LuaApi::Ret\nsrc/LuaApi.cpp" as RetApi
participant "Service::OnRetMsg\nsrc/Service.cpp" as OnRetA

LuaA -> CallApi: sunnet.Call(target, ...)
activate CallApi
CallApi -> CallApi: 校验参数\n必须在 coroutine 中

alt target 是服务名
    CallApi -> Sunnet: QueryName(name)
    Sunnet --> CallApi: targetId / -1
else target 是服务 id
    CallApi -> CallApi: targetId = lua_tointeger(1)
end

CallApi -> CallApi: 读取 __service_ptr
CallApi -> CallApi: 序列化参数 PackValue(...)
CallApi -> SrvA: SleepCurrentCoroutine(luaState, -1)
activate SrvA
SrvA -> SrvA: NewSession()
SrvA -> SrvA: lua_pushthread + luaL_ref\nsessionCoRefs[session] = coRef
SrvA --> CallApi
deactivate SrvA

CallApi -> CallApi: 构造 ServiceMsg\nkind=CALL, session=session
CallApi -> Sunnet: Send(targetId, msg)
activate Sunnet
Sunnet -> SrvB: PushMsg(msg)
Sunnet -> SrvB: 入 globalQueue / checkAndWeakUp()

alt 目标服务不存在或发送失败
    Sunnet --> CallApi: false
    CallApi -> SrvA: 清理 sessionCoRefs[session]
    CallApi --> LuaA: luaL_error("sunnet.Call send failed")
    deactivate Sunnet
    deactivate CallApi
else 发送成功
    Sunnet --> CallApi: true
    deactivate Sunnet
    CallApi --> LuaA: lua_yield()
    deactivate CallApi

    Worker -> SrvB: processMsgs(eachNum)
    activate Worker
    activate SrvB
    SrvB -> OnMsgB: OnServiceMsg(CALL)
    activate OnMsgB
    OnMsgB -> OnMsgB: kind == CALL\n准备 RpcContext
    OnMsgB -> LuaB: StartCallbackCoroutine(..., RpcContext)
    activate LuaB
    LuaB -> RetApi: sunnet.Ret(...)
    activate RetApi
    RetApi -> RetApi: 读取 __service_ptr\n查 coRpcContexts[current co]
    RetApi -> RetApi: 序列化返回值
    RetApi -> Sunnet: Send(sourceId, RET msg)
    Sunnet -> SrvA: PushMsg(msg)
    Sunnet -> SrvA: 入 globalQueue / checkAndWeakUp()
    RetApi --> LuaB: return 0
    deactivate RetApi
    deactivate LuaB
    OnMsgB --> SrvB
    deactivate OnMsgB
    deactivate SrvB
    deactivate Worker

    Worker -> SrvA: processMsgs(eachNum)
    activate Worker
    activate SrvA
    SrvA -> OnRetA: OnRetMsg(RET)
    activate OnRetA
    OnRetA -> OnRetA: sessionCoRefs.find(session)
    OnRetA -> OnRetA: lua_rawgeti 取回 coRef
    OnRetA -> OnRetA: UnpackValue(...) 压回返回值
    OnRetA -> SrvA: ResumeCoroutineRef(coRef, argc)
    SrvA -> LuaA: lua_resume\nsunnet.Call 返回
    deactivate OnRetA
    deactivate SrvA
    deactivate Worker
end

note over CallApi,OnRetA
CALL / RET 复用 ServiceMsg:
kind=CALL 表示请求，kind=RET 表示回复。
session 用来把返回值对应回 caller coroutine。
end note

@enduml
